cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this simulator, its scenarios or its findings, please cite it as below."
title: "Model Selection Clinic: an error-metric opportunity-cost simulator"
abstract: >-
  An interactive simulator that shows which model each error metric would select from a set of
  candidate models, and what that choice costs when judged by what the business actually values
  (profit, hits within capacity, value captured). Includes real KDD Cup 1998 model results.
